UTILITY: cksum (POSIX / BusyBox 1.38)
ADMITTED: file operands, stdin, multiple files
BANNED: none; cksum has no options
EXIT_STATUS: 0 all files processed, >0 error
FORMAT: "%u %d %s\n" (CRC32, octet count, pathname)
SECURITY: CRC32 is an integrity check, not a cryptographic hash. Use the
  websocket plugin only for transport, never for tamper evidence. A future
  sha256 plugin may be added for adversarial integrity.
RATIONALE: POSIX-native manifest for every final artifact
